## Task 2.3 hook

Task 1.2 exposes `grammar_tables()` in Rust with the eight field names and
shapes that `python/owl/kaggriculture/gpu_grammar.py` expects, but no PyO3
binding (`owl.rs.kaggriculture_grammar_tables`, Task 1.4), so
`native_grammar_tables` was not wired. Cross-check
(`native-tables-crosscheck/`): a scratch binary including
`src/kaggriculture/grammar.rs` dumped the tables; `grammar_tables_from_arrays`
accepts them and they equal `expected_grammar_tables` on all 964 bits.

